# Playwright visual regression baseline snapshots.
#
# DO NOT manually edit PNGs in this directory.
#
# To regenerate after intentional UI changes:
#   npx playwright test tests/visual/ --update-snapshots
#   git add tests/visual/snapshots/ && git commit -m "ci: refresh visual baselines"
#
# OR trigger workflow_dispatch on Visual regression with force_update=true.
#
# First-run bootstrap: when this directory has zero PNGs, the CI workflow
# auto-generates baselines and commits them with [skip ci]. Subsequent runs
# do diff comparison.
